  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Airbnb annual grant: providing temporary accommodation support to crisis-affected populations &#x2013; budget to cover staff support costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IOM-Airbnb.org Project 2025 aims to provide temporary accommodation to displaced individuals affected by humanitarian crises. The project offers short-term housing solutions through Airbnb, supporting refugees, asylum seekers, evacuees, and other displaced persons. Beneficiaries receive support from identification and approval to their stay and exit from the accomodation. The project integrates with other emergency response interventions ensuring a holistic approach to support vulnerable populations</narrative>
  </description>
